OL,3,GNEWSAExhibition hopes as cauldron
OL,4,Alifted from river
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are hopes an iron cauldron which
OL,7,Fwas lifted from a river bed could be
OL,8,Fdisplayed locally after further
OL,9,Fresearch.
OL,11,FThe object was recovered from the River
OL,12,FWear at Offerton, near Sunderland on
OL,13,FSunday and is currently in York, where
OL,14,Fconservation work is taking place.
OL,16,FGary Bankhead, who spotted the cauldron
OL,17,Fduring a dive in September 2025 said he
OL,18,Fwas "blown away" by the artefact's size
OL,19,Fwhen he finally saw it in daylight.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
